{"timestamp":"2026-11-02T07:53:07.564Z","ordinal":34284,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"custom_tool_call_output","id":"ctco_01a19b3f-6ceb-7620-a2bb-f909dfb6160f","call_id":"call_61094ee58d8347e48245eb36567aca54","output":[{"type":"input_text","text":"Script completed\nWall time 3.7 seconds\nOutput:\n"},{"type":"input_text","text":"[{\"name\":\"mcp__mcp_search__work_state_read\",\"description\":\"Read this project's to-do lists and working state written with work_state_write: every open item, or one list, with done and dropped items when includeClosed is true. Params: list, includeClosed. This tool is part of plugin `claude-mem`.\\n\\nexec tool declaration:\\n```ts\\ndeclare const tools: { mcp__mcp_search__work_state_read(args: {\\n  // Also show done and dropped items and closed lists\\n  includeClosed?: boolean;\\n  // Read only this list\\n  list?: string;\\n}): Promise<CallToolResult>; };\\n```\"},{\"name\":\"mcp__mcp_search__work_state_write\",\"description\":\"Your canonical to-do list and working state for this project, kept across sessions: whatever is still open is shown at the start of every session. Each call appends one entry to a list. To-do item: fields {\\\"task\\\": \\\"<name>\\\", \\\"status\\\": \\\"todo\\\" | \\\"doing\\\" | \\\"done\\\" | \\\"dropped\\\", ...details}. State on the list itself: any other fields (the latest value of each key wins; null clears a key; \\\"status\\\": \\\"done\\\" closes the list). Returns what is still open in the list. Params: list (required), fields (required). This tool is part of plugin `claude-mem`.\\n\\nexec tool declaration:\\n```ts\\ndeclare const tools: { mcp__mcp_search__work_state_write(args: {\\n  // Keys to set. Include \\\"task\\\" to update a to-do item. Values are strings, numbers, booleans, or null to clear a key.\\n  fields: { [key: string]: string | number | boolean | null; };\\n  // The to-do list or tracked thing this entry belongs to, e.g. \\\"release\\\" or \\\"auth-refactor\\\"\\n  list: string;\\n}): Promise<CallToolResult>; };\\n```\"}]"},{"type":"input_text","text":"    PID    PPID STAT     ELAPSED CMD\n 463114    6832 Ss         20:26 /usr/bin/zsh -lc set -e suite_pid=$$ python3 - \"$suite_pid\" <<'PY' import datetime,json,pathlib,sys p=pathlib.Path('/home/mike/nexus-code/.git/nexus-claims/SUITE/owner.json') d=json.loads(p.read_text()) assert d['agent']=='codex-root' and d['worktree']=='/home/mike/nexus-wt/v112-wp1104-suite-snapshot' d.update(pid=int(sys.argv[1]),scope='WP-1104 full npm test rerun 3 after isolated prior failures passed',heartbeat=datetime.datetime.now(datetime.timezone.utc).replace(microsecond=0).isoformat().replace('+00:00','Z')) p.write_text(json.dumps(d)+'\\n') PY task_home=$(mktemp -d /tmp/nexus-wp1104-suite-final3-home.XXXXXX) mkdir -p \"$task_home/.config\" \"$task_home/.local/share\" \"$task_home/.local/state\" HOME=\"$task_home\" XDG_CONFIG_HOME=\"$task_home/.config\" XDG_DATA_HOME=\"$task_home/.local/share\" XDG_STATE_HOME=\"$task_home/.local/state\" NEXUS_EVAL_TEST_WORKSPACE_ROOT=/mnt/nexus-eval-ci NEXUS_EVAL_TEST_RUNTIME_ROOT=/opt/nexus-eval-ci-runtime NEXUS_PACKAGE_ROOT=/home/mike/nexus-wt/v112-wp1104-package-smoke-final/extracted/nexus npm test > /home/mike/nexus-wt/v112-wp1104-suite-snapshot/wp1104-suite-final3.log 2>&1 run_status=$? tail -n 100 /home/mike/nexus-wt/v112-wp1104-suite-snapshot/wp1104-suite-final3.log exit \"$run_status\"\n 463518  463114 Sl         20:25 npm test\n 463536  463518 S          20:25 sh -c node scripts/run_tests.mjs && bash ../scripts/terminal-acceptance/test-scope-procs.sh\n 463537  463536 Sl         20:25 node scripts/run_tests.mjs\n2026-11-02 07:53:06.130438485 +0000 505598 wp1104-suite-final3.log\n[token_count] step=1 request_id=7ff588e3-1f93-49ba-963b-67b3115e7a2f source=client_estimate prompt_tokens=4690 client_estimate=4690 context_limit=65536 (client_default) output_allowance=8192 (client_default) tool_headroom_policy=4096 unmeasured=\"the connection advertises no request cou