le for file-based benchmark datasets. `--limit` is not\n66:The versioned dataset loader and installed `nexus eval --dataset ... --split ...` command support governed task populations. The CLI dispatches the packaged runner against a versioned dataset directory, while `eval/run.mjs` continues to accept the legacy task directory. Each dataset contains\n79:tasks. It can be run through the installed CLI with `nexus eval --dataset eval/datasets/core-v1 --split benchmark`. Held-out qualification corpora remain under their separately approved custody process and are not copied into\n"}],"internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a19b3e-e325-7090-bf1f-c31aa606240e","create_time":1793607740.2460396}},"metadata":{"client_authored":false,"fallback_token_limit_override":12000}}
